1
00:00:09,086 --> 00:00:10,546
[KNOCKING]

2
00:00:10,713 --> 00:00:12,503
LEONARD:
I'll get it.

3
00:00:22,808 --> 00:00:23,888
Psshoo.

4
00:00:27,229 --> 00:00:28,729
(Leonard:)Oh, no.

5
00:00:30,107 --> 00:00:31,147
SHELDON:
Oh, no.

6
00:00:32,443 --> 00:00:35,823
(Raj:)Make way for the fastest man alive.

7
00:00:35,988 --> 00:00:37,318
(Leonard:)Oh, no.

8
00:00:37,489 --> 00:00:40,279
(Sheldon:)See, this is why I wanted
to have a costume meeting.

9
00:00:40,451 --> 00:00:42,781
(Leonard:)We all have other costumes.
We can change.

10
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:45,870
(Raj:)Or we could walk right
behind each other all night.

11
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:48,750
It'll look like one person
going really fast.

12
00:00:56,008 --> 00:00:57,258
(Howard:)No, no, no.

13
00:00:57,426 --> 00:01:02,026
(Howard:)It's a boy-girl party,
this Flash runs solo.

